#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'OUT'
WDY-1532: top-level wendy.json files

Problem
  - apps often need model inputs, prompts, calibration data, or fixtures
  - these files change independently from application code
  - baking them into the image makes every data tweak look like a rebuild

Feature boundary
  - files are deployment inputs for wendy run
  - not persistent volumes
  - app-scoped, read-only at runtime, cleaned up with the app
OUT
